<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Dec m/m CPI 4.4 pct vs 1.8 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Dec m/m CPI 4.4 pct vs 1.8 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV INFLATION	   DEC	  NOV	 DEC 1995</p>
<p> monthly RPI index rise    + 4.4	+ 1.8	 + 7.0</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change	    +57.8	+65.6	  n.a.</p>
<p>NOTES -- December RPI index stood at 126 percent against average in 1995.</p>
<p>The average 1996 RPI index was 93.1 percent against the average previous year.</p>
<p>Figures refer to the Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro. -- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom ++381 11 222 4254</p>
